{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47107","headline":"寄荆门郑准 · 尚颜","name":"寄荆门郑准","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"传衣传鉢理难论，绮靡销磨二雅尊。\n不许姓名留月观，终携瓶锡去云门。\n窗间挂烛通宵在，竹上题诗隔岁存。\n珍重荆门郑从事，十年同受景升恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}